strata: gfx1151 (Strix Halo): 18 exact speed switches on by default (STRATA_GFX1151_DEFAULTS=0 turns them off; a switch you set is kept): GDN_HEAD GDN_PP GDN_CONVL2 GDN_NOY CVEC_FUSE HCD_EXACT PF_PAD TOPK_REG_MIN_BLOCKS Q8_PACKED Q6_PACKED MMVF_ROWS ATTN_LANECELL EXPERT_V2 TSUM LFUSE GDN_SPLIT QFUSE PLE_BATCH
strata: gfx1151 (Strix Halo): 2 exact speed switches on by default (STRATA_GFX1151_DEFAULTS=0 turns them off; a switch you set is kept): QFUSE SH_STREAM
strata: gfx1151 (Strix Halo): 2 exact speed switches on by default (STRATA_GFX1151_DEFAULTS=0 turns them off; a switch you set is kept): QFUSE SH_STREAM
strata: integrated GPU (gfx1103): the matrix-core prompt set is on (1.6x to 2x faster prompts on a Radeon 780M, the answers differ in the last bits): HIP_WMMA PF_GEMM PA_FAST SELECT_WMMA HC_UPMIX.  Turn one off with NAME=0 (for example STRATA_HC_UPMIX=0), all of them with STRATA_IGPU_PROMPT_SET=0
strata: gfx12 (RDNA4): exact extra switches on by default (STRATA_GFX12_DEFAULTS=0 turns them off; a switch you set is kept): HEAD_MIX_MULTI
strata: gfx12 (RDNA4): a model with K-quant experts (Unsloth UD-Q4/Q5/Q6_K_XL) reads its prompt on llama.cpp's MMQ kernels (+10..17% prompt speed on an R9700, first-token KL against the FP16 path about 0.03; STRATA_MMQ_KQ=0 or STRATA_GFX12_DEFAULTS=0 turns it off)
strata: gfx12 (RDNA4): the matrix-core QSA block scorer is on once a prompt is past 28,672 tokens (+5.7% prompt speed at 98K on an R9700, shorter prompts unchanged; the first-token KL against the warp kernel is 0.002 on average above 30K; STRATA_SELECT_WMMA=0 or STRATA_GFX12_DEFAULTS=0 turns it off)
strata: gfx12 (RDNA4): 12 exact speed switches on by default (STRATA_GFX12_DEFAULTS=0 turns them off; a switch you set is kept): GDN_HEAD GDN_PP GDN_CONVL2 GDN_NOY CVEC_FUSE ATTN_LANECELL ATTN_MERGE_V2 TSUM EXPDEC SMALL_UNR GR_Q32_G GR_Q8_PFS
strata: integrated GPU (gfx1103): the matrix-core prompt set is on (1.6x to 2x faster prompts on a Radeon 780M, the answers differ in the last bits): HIP_WMMA PF_GEMM PA_FAST SELECT_WMMA.  Turn one off with NAME=0 (for example STRATA_HC_UPMIX=0), all of them with STRATA_IGPU_PROMPT_SET=0
